# Public Docs Meta-Repo

This repository (`felixzhu97/public`) is the **Nx workspace root** for
catalogued Explore projects. It publishes architecture/living docs and shared
`packages/` (types, eslint, contracts, Java BOM). Prefer this single Git root
over nested remotes for new work.

## Publish whitelist

Stage **only** paths in [sync-repo](../skills/developers/public-docs/references/sync-repo.md):

- `README.md`, `.gitignore`, `.cursor/skills/**`
- `package.json`, `pnpm-lock.yaml`, `pnpm-workspace.yaml`, `nx.json`, `.npmrc`
- `packages/**`, `.github/workflows/**`
- `*/README.md`, `*/project.json`, `*/docs/Glossary.md`, `*/docs/product-owner/**`
- `*/docs/developer/c4-model/**`

Never `git add -A`. Never commit secrets (`.env`, credentials).

## Nested Git

Nested `.git` under `explore-*` is **legacy**. Hide as `.git.local` before
staging if present — see
[nested-git](../skills/developers/public-docs/references/nested-git.md).

Do not restructure `explore-*` into `apps/` / `libs/`; share via `packages/`.

## Delivery

- Branch: `<slug>` (no prefix) per [commit-pr](../skills/developers/public-docs/references/commit-pr.md)
- Dependent work: fine-grained **Draft PRs via GitHub Stack** (`gh stack`) —
  see [delivery-github-stack](../skills/developers/public-docs/references/delivery-github-stack.md)
- Living docs order: Glossary → domain model → other C4 → story map —
  see [living-docs](../skills/developers/public-docs/references/living-docs.md)

## Catalog changes

When onboarding or renaming a project, update together:

1. Root [README.md](../../README.md) Projects table (Title Case + kebab path)
2. [.gitignore](../../.gitignore) published project root (`!<name>/`)
3. [sync-repo](../skills/developers/public-docs/references/sync-repo.md) stage list
4. `project.json` under the project root for Nx registration
